# The Stone Gym. Three chambers, a minion guarding the gap into each, and
# the leader at the top.
#
# The gaps are offset so the route through is a zigzag, and each minion's
# sight line covers the only tile the player can enter their chamber through.
# That is the whole puzzle: the minions are not avoidable, they are just
# visible, because a trainer's sight line is drawn on the ground while they
# are unbeaten.
#
# The leader has no sight line. A gym leader is walked up to and challenged,
# not tripped over, and the badge is what opens the cave on Route 1.
#
# Everything here is stone type, and the starter is not strong against stone.
# The counter is in the tall grass one screen away: a MOSSLING is leaf, leaf
# breaks stone, and the player is expected to work that out or lose.

zone stonegym
name STONE GYM
size 13 16
indoor

tiles
WWWWWWWWWWWWW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WRRRRRfRRRRRW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WRfRRRRRRRRRW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WRRRRRRRRRfRW
WfffffffffffW
WfffffffffffW
WWWWWWdWWWWWW
end

warp 6 15 hometown 18 17 south

npc quarry 10 10 south trainer
  sight 3
  party dustbug 6, pebblin 6
  say Nobody walks in off the street.
  win The gap is yours. Good luck upstairs.
  lose Back out you go.
  reward 140
  flag beat_quarry
end

npc chisel 2 10 north trainer
  sight 2
  party pebblin 7, dustbug 7
  say Two down. You will not get a third.
  win Two down, then.
  lose That is as far as you go.
  reward 160
  flag beat_chisel
end

npc gravel 6 6 north trainer
  sight 2
  party dustbug 7, pebblin 8
  say The leader is right behind me. Prove it.
  say Prove you are worth her time.
  win She is waiting. Do not keep her.
  lose Come back when you can beat me.
  reward 180
  flag beat_gravel
end

npc granita 6 2 south trainer
  kind trainer
  party pebblin 9, dustbug 9, bouldrin 11
  say I am GRANITA. Stone does not move for anyone.
  say Show me something that does.
  win The STONE BADGE is yours. The cave is open.
  lose Stone does not move.
  reward 500
  flag badge_stone
end

event sign 5 13
  say STONE GYM. LEADER GRANITA.
  say STONE GROUNDS SPARK. LEAF BREAKS STONE.
end

event item 1 1 superpotion 1
  flag got_superpotion_gym
end
